   169	- Each compiled F stage compiled 8 graphs, one per call of the eight 256-row calls, and then logged `torch._dynamo hit config.recompile_limit (8)`. **All 1,024-row F cells ran eagerly**, so their gap of 2.4e-7 is not a compiled measurement.
