     1	"""Kaggriculture cases A-E of the value-gap diagnostic.
     2	
     3	One (precision, trunk) setting per process; the Inductor GEMM backend comes from
     4	gemm_backend_wrap.py. Model: preset configs/model/kaggriculture.yaml at 8fde43c,
