     9	Per row count R (256, 1,024):
    10	  pair  : S = model(obs) under no_grad (the rollout path);
    11	          R = model.evaluate_actions(obs, S.actions) with grad enabled (PPO).
    12	          Gaps R - S: values, critic logit difference log p(self) - log p(opp),
    13	          event log-probs, per-row joint log-ratio, entropies.
    14	  suppl : evaluate_actions under no_grad vs S; compute_value with grad vs S;
    15	          compute_value under no_grad vs S; a second grad replay vs the first;
    16	          a second no_grad sample (same seed) vs S.
    17	  hidden: (case E) encode_observations under no_grad vs with grad: trunk input,
    18	          trunk output at all present tokens, critic-value, plan and own-actor
    19	          tokens; each vs an fp32 eager padded-SDPA reference of the trunk
    20	          (TF32 off, autocast off, same trunk input); head swap = the critic
    21	          head applied (no_grad) to each path's hidden states.
    22	Then (case D) the actor head .out layers are re-initialised with gain 1.0
    23	(critic head, trunk and stems untouched) and the pair is repeated.
